draw.io (jgraph/drawio)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This product includes software and data from draw.io
(https://github.com/jgraph/drawio), tag v32.4.1,
Copyright (c) 2006-2025, JGraph Holdings Ltd / draw.io AG,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(see third_party/drawio/LICENSE and third_party/drawio/README.md).

Ported shapes and the stencil engine are under src/drawio-shapes/:
  - src/drawio-shapes/engine/        stencil engine, codec, light-dark() colours, <mxlibrary>
                                     loading (from Graph.js, Editor.js, EditorUi.js)
  - src/drawio-shapes/js/shapes-core/   vertex shapes and perimeters (from js/grapheditor/Shapes.js)
  - src/drawio-shapes/js/shapes-edges/  edge, markup and table shapes, table/stack layouts,
                                        isometric edge style (from Shapes.js and Graph.js)
  - src/drawio-shapes/js/mx-libs/    shapes/mxBasic.js, shapes/mxArrows.js, shapes/mxFlowchart.js
  - src/shapes/drawio-arrows/        legacy aliases of the mxArrows ports
Palette data in src/drawio-shapes/palettes/data/ (from the Sidebar*.js palettes) and the
stencil sets in public/stencils/ (from js/stencils.min.js) are generated from it by
scripts/drawio-palettes/ (npm run drawio:palettes).

Each ported file carries the draw.io copyright line, the Apache-2.0 notice and the upstream
file/line references. Changes: translated to TypeScript for @maxgraph/core 0.10.

The draw.io stencil libraries are subject to the additional terms in public/stencils/LICENSE
(no use in Atlassian products or the Atlassian marketplace without written permission;
diagrams created by end users are not affected).

